 "provenance": "Tibet 12 (secret stage, world 2 level 11) normal exit 39,23 from the spawn, control-only on the exact S700 core (engine s700-core-2). Start values are those of a first visit: core/res/map_tibet.out links Tibet 12 (node 2,5) only to Tibet 2 (node 2,8), so it is unlocked by the Tibet 2 secret exit, before the Tibet 6 ice hammer. weaponTier 2 (choosing Tibet on the seal gives the hook; only the hammer is used here), maxHealth 4 (default, no armor), lives 12 (campaign value used by the old routes; no life is lost), diamonds/redDiamonds 0 (diamonds are per stage). The magic diamond lock that info.ts lists at 38,23 (35 diamonds) never blocks in this S700 logic: the map scan (method_304 case 12) already sets tile(38,23) to -1 at load, and only the counter field_156 remains (it runs down to -1 here). The 36 diamonds collected on the way are incidental and not needed for the exit. Route: walk in, collect the row-4 diamonds 14..19,4, go down through the grass 19,5 and 19,6 and push the stone 20,6 east (it falls down column 21), step to 21,6 and hammer the brick 22,6 (presses at t122 and t134); the brick block 22..25 x 4..8 collapses and frees the two upper ice creatures (24,4 and 23,5). Stay at 21,6 facing east and strike each creature when it comes next to the hero at 22,6: with weaponTier 2 the hammer stuns an ice creature and the 4th hit kills it (method_230), so the first dies at t213 and the second at t270 without any damage (40 action presses at t174..t269, one every other tick while a creature is adjacent; presses during the 12-tick hammer animation do nothing). Then collect the upper diamonds (18 in total by t591), activate checkpoints 39,3 (t625) and 36,9 (t700), go west along row 14 and wait at 30,14 under the ceiling trap 30,13, which falls on the hero (t783, the only damage, hp 4 -> 3; if the hero runs under it without stopping, the trap drops through the open bridge 30,14 and breaks the bricks 30..32,17, and the same controls with that wait shortened get stuck at 33,15 or 36,15). Open chest 24,13 for silver key 1 (t879), open silver lock 34,14 (gate 0, t971), push stone 33,15 east through gate 0 so it drops onto plate 35,16 (gate 1, t1038), collect the right-column diamonds (36 in total at t1426), activate checkpoint 37,19 (t1439). Push stone 31,23 west to 30,23 (t1501) and cut the grass 30,24 so the stone drops to 30,24 (t1520); the ceiling trap 30,22 then falls onto that stone (t1552) instead of breaking the bricks under stones 31,23/33,23. Push the stone west along row 24 onto plate 27,24 (gate 2, t1607), take silver key 2 from chest 23,24 (t1709), open silver lock 34,22 (gate 3, t1821), push stone 33,23 east through gate 3 so it drops onto plate 35,24 (gate 4, t1897), and walk through gate 4 and over the already open cell 38,23 to exit 39,23. Result: exit at tick 1978 (hero at 51,23, state 35), hp 3, 36 diamonds, one damage, no deaths, no resets.",
